add('quiz','预测一个新例子：abaca 有多少个不同非空回文？仍按字符串内容去重。提示：把外层为 a 的组，与 b、c 的组分开；每组用最早和最晚的出现位置。先选择数量，再揭晓。','Predict a fresh case: how many distinct nonempty palindromes does abaca contain? Count by string content. Hint: separate the outer-a group from b and c; use the earliest and latest occurrences in each group. Choose a count before revealing.')
