add('answer','abaca → {a, b, c, aa, aaa, aba, aca}，共 7。a 组用 L=0、R=4，内部 bac 的回文是 b、a、c，因此贡献 2+3=5；b、c 各贡献 1。','abaca → {a, b, c, aa, aaa, aba, aca}: 7 total. The a group uses L=0 and R=4; interior bac has palindromes b, a, c, contributing 2+3=5. The b and c groups contribute 1 each.')
add('why0','选 5 只数了 a 组，还少了单字符 b 和 c。','Choosing 5 counts only the a group and misses the single letters b and c.')
