add('codeIntro','这一步要回答：如何把区间证明写成官方 Python3 接口？下面的 Solution.countPalindromicSubsequences(s) 返回整数。代码中的 dp 就是前文的 D：不同非空回文数量对 MOD 的余数。','How does the interval proof become an official Python3 submission? Solution.countPalindromicSubsequences(s) below returns an integer. Its dp is the D from the derivation: the count of distinct nonempty palindromes, reduced modulo MOD.')
add('map','next_pos[i][c] 保存从 i 起最早的字符 c 的位置；prev_pos[j][c] 保存到 j 为止最晚的位置。字符 a…d 对应列 0…3。预处理时复制上一行，再只更新当前字符；这样每个区间查 L、R 都是常数时间。length 按从短到长扫描；left/right 对应 L/R；total 累加四个互斥组。','next_pos[i][c] stores the earliest occurrence of letter c at or after i; prev_pos[j][c] stores the latest at or before j. Letters a…d map to columns 0…3. Preprocessing copies the preceding row and updates only the current letter, so each interval finds L and R in constant time. length scans from short to long; left/right are L/R; total sums the four disjoint groups.')
add('bounds','边界：找不到下一个字符时用 n，找不到上一个时用 −1；left>right 表示区间内没有该字符。left==right 只计一个；相邻端点的内部为空，inner=0。长度 1 返回 1；全为同一个字符时恰有 n 个（长度 1 到 n）。四个互不重复字符 abcd 只有 4 个。所有相加最后取余，不影响分组证明。','Boundaries: a missing next occurrence uses n, and a missing previous occurrence uses −1. left>right means the letter is absent from the interval. left==right counts one; adjacent endpoints have inner=0. Length 1 returns 1. With one repeated letter there are exactly n results, of lengths 1 through n. Four different letters abcd give only 4. Taking the remainder after summing preserves the counting argument.')
add('cost','成本：预处理 O(4n)；n(n+1)/2 个区间各检查 4 个字符，所以 O(n²) 时间。dp 有 n² 个整数，出现位置表 O(4n)，总辅助空间 O(n²)。这里按固定模数整数运算计成本。教学图保存小表的历史快照及字符串清单，这些不是提交代码的存储。','Cost: preprocessing takes O(4n). There are n(n+1)/2 intervals, each checking 4 letters, so time is O(n²). dp stores n² integers; occurrence tables take O(4n), giving O(n²) auxiliary space under fixed-modulus integer arithmetic. The teaching diagram retains small-table snapshots and string lists; the submission does not store that history.')
add('verification','自查方法：用独立的子序列枚举检查短输入的每个区间；用另一种端点去重递推检查大输入，再核对官方样例和全相同字符的边界。测试不是 LeetCode 提交，也不是学习者效果或独立评审的证明。','Self-check method: compare every short interval with independent subsequence enumeration; use a different endpoint-deduplication recurrence for larger inputs, plus official examples and repeated-letter boundaries. These tests are not a LeetCode submission, learner-outcome evidence, or independent review.')
